{"v":3,"catch":"Lines 98 Classic —— 規劃你的步數。構築完美的線條。","desc":"《Lines 98 Classic》是一款傳奇益智遊戲，許多人自幼便對其耳熟能詳。玩家需將同色球體橫向、縱向或斜向連成直線，清除棋盤並盡可能累積高分。\n\n遊戲規則簡明、操作直覺，上手容易卻蘊含深邃策略深度。悠閒的節奏搭配永無止境的腦力挑戰，無論追求快速休閒體驗或長時間沉浸式挑戰高分紀錄，《Lines 98 Classic》皆能完美契合。","publisher":"Soroka Games","release":"2026-02-05","genres":["益智","街機","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/04711086dd0c5d4b0cc1c0691dc25bf54215f9978b96e8c96604226e2febf394.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90bcb0f97f3be1801f25834f94d6ac9b0645b631c555d84e639e5803a5a3b9a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b57dadba79b744cbf718af86b5246b15ce3a7a55b1bcca4d961ddeec5105b38a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b61caa35f3a1fd05b227d0904702b9ff2a2298d1d8fd00396ef271203b569471.jpg"],"titleId":"01000530268e2000","dlc":[]}